/-! ## Tenth-order `φ` and `ψ`

Chan/Ramanujan's tenth-order `φ` and `ψ` use the denominator
`(q;q²)_{n+1} = (1-q)(1-q³)⋯(1-q^{2n+1})`.  The coefficient definitions
below compute the inverse of each finite odd product by truncated convolution.
-/

